    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good angle, but is it enough? If I'm the client and I see a report that basically says \"we found nothing,\" I'm going to think I don't need to spend more money. I need something a bit more concrete to justify the higher cost of the monitoring package. Can we point to any specific gaps or upcoming risks that would make them feel like they're currently exposed if they stay on their current plan?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
